.TH "AG\-CLI\-NOTIFICATION\-LIST" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-notification\-list \- List repository notifications
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli notification list [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&List notifications for a repository, most recent first.
.PP
\&By default all notifications are listed; \-\-unread keeps only unread ones.
\&\-\-since and \-\-before accept RFC 3339 timestamps (for example
\&2026\-08\-14T00:00:00+08:00). \-\-type keeps only notifications of one type,
\&such as merge_requests_open or issue_open.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-before <string>\fR
\&Only list notifications updated before this RFC 3339 timestamp
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output notifications as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-L, \-\-limit <int>\fR
\&Maximum number of notifications to list
\&Default: \(dq30\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-since <string>\fR
\&Only list notifications updated at or after this RFC 3339 timestamp
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-type <string>\fR
\&Only list notifications of this type (for example merge_requests_open)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-unread\fR
\&Only list unread notifications
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli notification list owner/repo \-\-limit 20
\&  ag\-cli notification list \-\-unread \-\-json
\&  ag\-cli notification list owner/repo \-\-type issue_open \-\-since 2026\-08\-01T00:00:00Z
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBag\-cli\-notification\fR(1)
